Portenta Machine Control Explorer
=================================

This repository is licensed in two parts, deliberately.

APACHE-2.0
----------

    boards/shields/arduino_portenta_machine_control/**
    pmc-partitions.dtsi

The shield is the part of this repository with value to anyone else: it
describes the carrier, not this application, and
-DSHIELD=arduino_portenta_machine_control is the thing another project would
want. The Zephyr project requires Apache-2.0 for upstream contributions, so
licensing it this way keeps that door open rather than closing it by default.

pmc-partitions.dtsi is Apache-2.0 because it is derived from the flash map of
a sibling project on the same SoC, which carries that license. Re-licensing
derived work is not ours to do.

